WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.401
On a profile, the Orchestrator picker offers Default, Claude and Copilot.

00:00:08.401 --> 00:00:13.930
The orchestrator controls how tools are selected and how the answer loop runs.

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:17.233
Choose Copilot, and its settings appear.

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:21.325
When Copilot is not set up on the site, the profile says so:

00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:25.231
it cannot be used until it is configured in the settings.

00:00:25.681 --> 00:00:30.357
Allow all tool executions lets Copilot run its tools without asking.

00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:34.653
Once Copilot is set up, the section also offers a model and an

00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:37.244
Effort level, and a GitHub sign-in.

00:00:37.244 --> 00:00:41.730
A sign-in stored on the profile is lent to every person who chats

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.941
with it, so use it with care.

00:00:44.409 --> 00:00:48.470
Choose Claude, and it also says when it is not configured.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:52.468
Once it is, a model and an Effort level can be chosen for

00:00:52.468 --> 00:00:56.719
the profile, and an empty model uses the default of the site.

